{"ID":"20240118151339-4p4jred","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151339-4p4jred","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151339-4p4jred\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151339-1bucy5r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122081729-m81ojwu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122081728-hhby7eb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:122,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:122\u0026#125;","title":"054蘼芜（川芎苗）","type":"doc","updated":"20240129092644"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151339-1bucy5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151339-1bucy5r","updated":"20240122081721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛性温，主咳逆定惊气辟邪恶，除蛊毒鬼注，去三虫，久服通神。即川芎之苗也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122081724-ttofih4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081724-ttofih4"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】身中老风，头中久风，风眩。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122081741-jl4hzg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081741-jl4hzg8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】作饮止泄泻。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122081727-5f51fxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081727-5f51fxz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时珍】蘼芜花入面脂用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122081728-6dttgrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081728-6dttgrn"}},{"ID":"20240122081728-e9he1io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081728-e9he1io"}},{"ID":"20240122081728-hhby7eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081728-hhby7eb","updated":"20240129092644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那第五十四味药，蘼芜这个药我们也很少用，这个是川芎的苗，川芎，我们用川芎的根，川芎的苗就是这个，我们经方很少用川芎的苗。过去川芎的苗拿来做面霜，以前没有lotion，但是还知道女人要防晒…要面霜，也是白一点好看，什么一白遮三丑，反正它名词很多啦，女孩子嘛，这倒无所谓，真的用的是川芎。"}]},{"ID":"20240122081729-m81ojwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122081729-m81ojwu"}}]}